contentText:
Jayden James, the 19-year-old son of Britney Spears and Kevin Federline , is the latest face of MAC Cosmetics&#8217; relaunched digital publication MACzine , which revealed his cover on Tuesday (Aug. 25).

In the cover image, James is seen holding the brand&#8217;s Fix+ Setting Spray as he looks directly into the camera, while the cover poses a cheeky question: &#8220;Who the f&#8212; is Jayden James?&#8221;

